## ⚙️ Backend Setup

### 1️⃣ Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Usershruthi23/portfolio-fullstack.git
```

### 2️⃣ Navigate to Project Folder

```bash
cd portfolio-fullstack
```

### 3️⃣ Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### 4️⃣ Create Environment File

Create a `.env` file in the root directory and add:

```env
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
PORT=5000
```

### 5️⃣ Start Server

```bash
node server.js
```

Frontend can be run using the Live Server extension in VS Code.


## 📡 API Endpoint

### Contact Form

**POST** `/api/contact`

### Sample Request

```json
{
  "name": "Shruthi",
  "email": "shruthi@gmail.com",
  "message": "Hello Backend"
}
```

### Sample Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Message submitted successfully"
}
```


## 🗄️ Database

All contact form submissions are securely stored in MongoDB Atlas using Mongoose.



